{
  "title": "Unified Content and Document Management System",
  "overview": "This system provides comprehensive capabilities for managing various forms of content, including static pages, rich text content within courses, and general documents. It features robust S3 integration for file storage, localization support, and a streamlined workflow for content creation, editing, and display. The architecture combines core application logic with specialized components for administrative tasks, course-specific content, and potentially a microservice for document and media asset management.",
  "functional_domains": [
    {
      "name": "Static Pages Management",
      "description": "Enables the creation, display, and administrative editing of static content pages (e.g., imprint, FAQ).",
      "details": [
        "**Model:** `Page` (ActiveRecord) manages specific versions of static pages, identified by `name` and `locale`.",
        "**Localization:** Supports multiple translations for a given page `name` using `preferred_locales` for retrieval.",
        "**Content Storage:** `text` attribute uses `Xikolo::S3::Markup` to manage S3 file references (images, PDFs).",
        "**Viewing:** `Home::PagesController#show` retrieves pages based on `I18n.locale`. Content is wrapped by `PagePresenter`. Missing pages raise 404 unless `helpdesk.page.store` permission is present, allowing on-the-fly creation.",
        "**Editing:** `PagesController` handles administrative `edit` and `update` actions, requiring `helpdesk.page.store` permission.",
        "**File Uploads:** `Xikolo::S3::TextWithUploadsProcessor` manages embedded file uploads, configuring S3 keys (e.g., `pages/{page.name}/{id}/{File.basename upload.key}`), ACLs, and cache controls.",
        "**Deletion:** `S3FileDeletionJob` is scheduled (1-minute delay) to remove unreferenced files after updates."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Course Rich Text Management",
      "description": "Manages rich text content embedded within courses, such as learning materials.",
      "details": [
        "**Model:** `Course::Richtext` (ActiveRecord) is polymorphically associated with `Course::Item` as its `content`.",
        "**Content Storage:** `text` attribute uses `Xikolo::S3::Markup` for S3 file uploads, specifically for the `course_richtext` purpose.",
        "**Storage Logic:** `Course::Richtext::Store` operation encapsulates creation/update logic, utilizing `Xikolo::S3::TextWithUploadsProcessor` for file handling.",
        "**File Uploads:** S3 keys are specific to courses (e.g., `courses/{cid}/rtfiles/{upload.unique_sanitized_name}`).",
        "**Deletion:** `S3FileDeletionJob` is scheduled (1-hour delay) for obsolete files, but only if they are not referenced by other `Course::Richtext` instances or `Course::Course` descriptions (checked via `self.referenced?`)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "General Document and Media Asset Management",
      "description": "Provides broader capabilities for managing documents and media assets, including administrative and course-specific contexts, with localization support.",
      "details": [
        "**Models:** `Document` and `DocumentLocalization` manage general documents and their localized versions.",
        "**Administrative Control:** `Admin::DocumentsController` and `Admin::DocumentLocalizationsController` facilitate management of documents and their translations.",
        "**Course-Specific Documents:** `Course::DocumentsController` handles documents within courses, supported by `Course::Documents::FilterBar`, `Course::DocumentsPresenter`, `DocumentHelper`, and `DocumentsListPresenter` for UI/UX.",
        "**Microservice Integration:** A 'Course-specific Document and Media Asset Management Microservice' is indicated, potentially handling `Document`, `DocumentLocalization`, `DocumentsItem`, `DocumentsController`, and `DocumentLocalizationsController` for course-related assets in a distributed manner."
      ]
    }
  ],
